	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Has breviculas ideo dumtaxat scribo, ne noster <lb xml:id="p1z2"/><persName ref="p2242">Müllerus</persName> vacuis ad te manibus veniat et sine <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>meis.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">De rebus nostris ipse omnia exponere potest.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Ego hisce diebus frequentibus et prolixioribus defatigatus <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>concionibus ad scribendum sum piger; sed et <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>morbi me varii non tam exercent quam mihi ipsi et <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>aliis prope inutilem reddunt.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Iam nunc dolores <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>sentio ex dextro latere et ex vesica maximos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Ultimas <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>tuas accepi a clarissimo viro d. quaestore, qui, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quae scivit, exposuit amplius expectans a te, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>a quo et ego expectarem, nisi scirem, quibus oppressus <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>negotiis laborares, ut nolim tibi conduplicare labores <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>et molestias.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Si commode et per ocium aliquid potes, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>effice; gratificaberis utrique.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Diligenter de <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>rebus tuis, et quo loco habeare a tuis quidve <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>intellexerit a tuis, investigavi.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Respondit te <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>in authoritate esse ac diligi magnique fieri a <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>bonis omnibus, quo nomine plurimum tum d. consul <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>cum ipse sit exhileratus.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Nullae ad ipsos delatae <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>sunt de te querelae; nemo te accusavit apud ipsos.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Quod autem literas attinet, quas ad me toto hoc tempore <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>a comitiis Martinianis misisti, diligenter eas <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>asservavi.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Memini quoque te bullam mittere; sed cum <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>illam repeteres, absque dilatione remisi illam <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>neque descripsi neque describi curavi, cum scirem <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>eam inveniri apud te, atque nunc magis quam <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>tunc inspicere illam cuperem.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la">Perdidit illa <lb xml:id="p1z28"/><placeName ref="l2604">Rezüntium</placeName>; est enim papa filius perditionis<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Joh 17, 12</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>2Thess 2, 3</ref></cit>.</note> et <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>homo peccati,</foreign> und habend imm die <placeName ref="l648">Pündter</placeName> fast rächt <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>gethan, das sy die lähen ires landts dem bapst zuͦ <lb xml:id="p1z31"/><placeName ref="l425">Rom</placeName> nitt lassen wöllend.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Was rächts hat er <foreign xml:lang="la">(praeter <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>rapinam, imposturam et extremam impudentiam)</foreign> an ander <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>lüthen lähen und guͤtern?</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Stultitia et superstitio <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>hominum deceptorum hoc illi hactenus permisit; <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>itaque prudentia religiosa sanorum hominum eri<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>piat et extorqueat illi rursus ex manibus etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/>Dominus benedicat vobis et conservet vos a malo.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>aeternum.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> 4. aprilis 1572.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z39"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> tu<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>us<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Ohne Adresse.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
